<title>ZAMBIA: Zambia's ZCCM urges miners not to strike.</title>
<headline>Zambia's ZCCM urges miners not to strike.</headline>
<dateline>LUSAKA 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zambia Consolidated Copper Mines (ZCCM) urged disgruntled mineworkers on Monday not to call a strike over low wages as it was working to improve conditions of service.</p>
<p>In a joint statement with the Mineworkers Union of Zambia, ZCCM said delays in implementing pay rises were caused by the company's privatisation programme. It said new salaries would be announced as soon as negotiations had been completed.</p>
</text>
